flowchart TD
    A([Mulai Checkout]) --> B[Ambil Item dari Cart]
    B --> C{Cart Kosong?}
    C -->|Ya| D[Tampilkan Pesan Cart Kosong]
    D --> Z([Selesai])
    C -->|Tidak| E[InventoryService.check_stock cart]
    E --> F{Stok Cukup?}
    F -->|Tidak| G[Tolak Checkout / Info Stok Kurang]
    G --> Z
    F -->|Ya| H[PricingService.calculate cart -> PricingResult]
    H --> I[Input Pembayaran & compute_change]
    I --> J{validate_payment Valid?}
    J -->|Tidak| K[Minta Input Ulang Pembayaran]
    K --> I
    J -->|Ya| L[InventoryService.reduce_for_order & Simpan PAID]
    L --> M[Tampilkan Struk & Update Laporan]
    M --> Z